 Pad. DESCRIPTION Excellent feel and modulation, this sintered pad compound is built for off road and street use depending on the application. Great heat recovery and easy on the rotor, this is our most popular high-performance compound. Precision made in our Galfer factory in Spain. BEST USE For moderately aggressive riding on street or off road. Great for everyday sport street riding, canyons and aggressive or heavy braking. For off road applications, this compound is excellent in varying conditions, handling high heat and race use. More Information Brand Model CC Year Front Rear APRILIA CAPONORD RAID 1000 03- FD172 FD138 APRILIA ETV CAPONORD 1000 01- FD172 FD220 APRILIA MOTO 6.5 650 95- FD172 FD135 APRILIA PEGASO 1000 1000 01- FD172 FD165 APRILIA PEGASO 650 650 98-00 FD172 FD075 APRILIA PEGASO 650 ie 650 01-Jun FD172 FD165 BENELLI TRX 502 500 18- FD172 FD345 BIMOTA DBx 1100 13- FD172 FD172 BMW C1 125 125 00- FD172 FD165 BMW C1 200 200 01- FD172 FD165 BMW F 650 650 93- FD172 FD165 BMW F 650 CS SCARVER 650 01- FD172 FD165 BMW F 650 DAKAR 650 00-01 FD172 FD165 BMW F 650 GS 650 00- FD172 FD165 BMW F 650 GS BICILINDRICO 650 07- FD172 FD165 BMW F 650 ST 650 97- FD172 FD165 BMW F 700 GS 700 13- FD172 FD165 BMW F 750 GS 750 18- FD172 FD165 BMW F 800 GS 800 08- FD172 FD165 BMW F 850 GS 850 18- FD172 FD165 BMW G 650 GS 650 09- FD172 FD165 BMW G 650 XCHALLENGE 650 07- FD172 FD165 BMW G 650 XCOUNTRY 650 07- FD172 FD165 BMW HP 2 ENDURO 1150 05- FD172 FD186 BMW HP 2 SM 1150 06-Jun FD172 FD186 BMW K 1600 B 1600 17- FD272 FD172 BMW K 1600 GRAND AMERICA 1600 18- FD272 FD172 BMW K 1600 GT 1600 11- FD272 FD172 BMW K 1600 GT SE 1600 12- FD272 FD172 BMW K 1600 GTL 1600 11- FD272 FD172 BMW K 1600 GTL E 1600 12- FD272 FD172 BMW R 1200 GS LC 1200 13- FD475 FD172 BMW R 1200 GS LC ADVENTURE 1200 13- FD475 FD172 BMW R 1200 R 1200 15- FD475 FD172 BMW R 1200 RS 1200 15- FD475 FD172 BMW R 1200 RT LC 1200 14- FD475 FD172 BMW R 1250 GS 1250 19- FD537 FD172 BMW R 1250 GS ADVENTURE 1250 19- FD537