formance for the Aerox model. Its 230mm diameter ensures optimal contact with the brake pads, delivering consistent and reliable braking under various conditions. This feature enhances rider safety and confidence, making it an essential upgrade for performance-focused riders. 2. Precision Engineering Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, the RCB Brake Disc showcases advanced manufacturing techniques that ensure durability and precision. This brake disc is engineered to withstand the rigors of daily use while maintaining its structural integrity, resulting in a long-lasting product that can handle the demands of both urban commuting and spirited riding. 3. Lightweight Design The RCB Brake Disc E2 Series boasts a lightweight construction that minimizes unsprung weight, enhancing the overall handling and agility of the Aerox. This design not only improves acceleration and deceleration but also contributes to a more responsive riding experience, allowing riders to maneuver with ease and precision. 4. Optimized Heat Dissipation Featuring an innovative design that promotes effective heat dissipation, this brake disc helps prevent brake fade during prolonged use. This characteristic is crucial for maintaining consistent braking performance, especially during high-speed rides or extended braking sessions, ensuring that riders can trust their brakes when it matters most. 5. Brand Reliability RCB is a trusted name in the motorcycle parts industry, known for its commitment to quality and performance. The E2 Series Brake Disc reflects the brand's dedication to providing high-performance components that meet the needs of serious riders. Choosing RCB means investing in a product that combines reliability with cutting-edge technology for an enhanced riding experience.88:Ta6e,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Take your Yamaha R15 V3 braking performance to the next level with the 66BHP Venta 282mm Floating Brake Disc. Engineered for riders who demand sharper braking response, improved heat management, and greater control, this premium floating rotor is designed as a direct OEM replacement with no modifications or alterations required. Featuring a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc delivers exceptional stopping performance while maintaining reliability for both daily riding and spirited weekend rides. Key Highlights ✅ Direct Fit for Yamaha R15 V3 Designed as a true OEM replacement. No drilling, spacers, or modifications required—simply install using the factory mounting points. ✅ 282mm Performance Rotor Optimized braking surface delivers stronger, more progressive braking performance with excellent rider feedback. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision CNC-machined aluminium centre helps reduce unsprung weight while maintaining structural strength. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor High-quality stainless steel braking surface provides excellent wear resistance, consistent braking performance, and long service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Allows controlled movement between the carrier and braking surface, helping reduce brake judder while ensuring consistent pad contact. ✅ Performance Ventilation Special ventilation pattern improves airflow and heat dissipation, maintaining braking performance even during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Designed to offer enhanced braking confidence, improved modulation, and greater control in all riding conditions. Features 282mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility Yamaha R15 V3 What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 282mm Floating Front Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? The 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc is engineered for riders who want more than just an OEM replacement. With advanced floating construction, a lightweight aluminium carrier, premium stainless steel braking surface, and performance-focused ventilation, it delivers dependable braking performance, improved heat management, and enhanced rider confidence every time you squeeze the brake lever. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.89:Tb81,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Take your KTM Adventure 250 (2021–2023) to the next level with the 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc. Designed for riders who demand precise braking performance on highways, twisty roads, and off-road adventures, this premium floating rotor delivers exceptional stopping power, improved heat dissipation, and outstanding braking consistency. Manufactured with a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc is a direct OEM replacement that installs using the factory mounting points—no modifications or alterations required. Key Highlights ✅ Direct Fit for KTM Adventure 250 (2021–2023) Engineered to OEM specifications for a perfect fit. No drilling, spacers, or modifications required. ✅ 320mm Performance Rotor Large diameter rotor provides increased braking leverage for stronger, more progressive stopping power and greater rider confidence. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision CNC-machined aluminium carrier helps reduce unsprung weight while maintaining exceptional structural strength. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor High-grade stainless steel braking surface ensures excellent durability, consistent braking performance, and long service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Floating construction allows controlled movement between the carrier and braking surface, ensuring optimal pad contact while helping reduce brake judder. ✅ Performance Ventilation Performance-oriented ventilation pattern improves airflow and heat dissipation, maintaining braking efficiency even during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Designed to provide improved brake feel, enhanced modulation, and dependable braking performance across every riding condition. Features 320mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility KTM Adventure 250 (2021–2023) What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? The 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc is engineered for riders who expect uncompromising braking performance. Combining a lightweight aluminium carrier, premium stainless steel braking surface, advanced floating construction, and a performance ventilation design, it delivers consistent braking, excellent heat management, and superior stopping power for every adventure. Whether you're navigating city traffic, touring long distances, or exploring challenging roads, the Venta Floating Disc gives you the confidence to brake later, smoother, and with complete control. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.8a:Tba1,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Engineered for riders who push the limits, the 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc is the perfect braking upgrade for the KTM Adventure 390 (2020–2023). Whether you're tackling mountain roads, touring long distances, or navigating daily traffic, this premium floating rotor delivers exceptional stopping power, improved heat dissipation, and precise braking control. Built with a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc is a direct OEM replacement that installs using the factory mounting points—n