powerful, fade-resistant braking and outstanding control in every riding condition. From everyday commuting to spirited weekend rides and long-distance adventures, the Venta Floating Disc is built to perform when it matters most. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.OE Part Number : JF131876 and JG1318658b:Tc49,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Unlock superior braking performance for your KTM Duke 200 (2017–2025) with the 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc. Designed for riders who demand maximum braking confidence, this premium floating rotor delivers stronger stopping power, improved heat dissipation, and precise brake modulation for everyday riding and spirited performance. Manufactured using a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc is engineered as a direct OEM replacement, offering a perfect fit with no modifications or alterations required. Key Highlights ✅ Direct Fit for KTM Duke 200 (2017–2025) Engineered to OEM specifications for a hassle-free installation using the factory mounting points. No drilling, spacers, or modifications required. ✅ 320mm Performance Rotor Large diameter rotor provides increased braking leverage for stronger, smoother, and more controlled stopping performance. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision CNC-machined aluminium carrier reduces unsprung weight while maintaining exceptional strength and rigidity. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor High-grade stainless steel braking surface ensures excellent wear resistance, reliable braking performance, and long service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Floating construction allows controlled movement between the carrier and braking surface, ensuring consistent pad contact while helping reduce brake judder. ✅ Performance Ventilation Performance-oriented ventilation pattern improves airflow and heat dissipation, helping maintain braking efficiency during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Engineered to deliver enhanced brake feel, improved modulation, and dependable braking performance across city roads, highways, and spirited rides. Features 320mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility KTM Duke 200 (2017–2025) OE Cross Reference Compatible as a replacement for the following OEM reference numbers: JP131818 JP131861 These OE reference numbers are provided for fitment verification purposes only. What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? The 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc is engineered for riders who refuse to compromise on braking performance. Combining a lightweight aluminium carrier, premium stainless steel braking surface, advanced floating technology, and a performance ventilation design, it delivers exceptional stopping power, fade resistance, and braking consistency in every riding condition. Whether you're commuting daily, carving through corners, or enjoying weekend rides, the Venta Floating Brake Disc provides the confidence and performance your KTM deserves. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.8c:Tc37,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Enhance the braking performance of your KTM Duke 250 (2017–2023) with the 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc. Designed for riders who demand precision, reliability, and superior stopping power, this premium floating rotor offers improved heat dissipation, excellent brake feel, and consistent braking performance in every riding condition. Manufactured using a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc i