tent braking under aggressive riding conditions. Designed specifically for the Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 and Continental GT 650, the Venta Floating Disc combines a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier with a high-grade stainless steel braking surface for exceptional performance on both the street and spirited weekend rides. Key Highlights ✅ 320mm Performance Rotor Larger braking surface provides improved braking leverage for stronger and more controlled stopping power. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision-machined aluminium centre reduces unsprung weight while maintaining excellent rigidity. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor High-quality stainless steel braking surface offers excellent durability, consistent friction, and long service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Allows controlled movement between the carrier and rotor, helping reduce brake judder while maintaining optimal pad contact. ✅ Performance Ventilation Specially designed ventilation pattern improves airflow and heat dissipation, helping maintain braking performance even during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Engineered to provide improved brake feel, greater modulation, and increased rider confidence. Features 320mm Performance Floating Brake Disc CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Performance Ventilation Design Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Excellent Heat Dissipation Improved Brake Feel & Modulation Direct Fit Installation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility Royal Enfield Interceptor 650 Royal Enfield Continental GT 650 What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 320mm Floating Front Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? Every 66BHP Venta Floating Disc is designed for riders who expect confidence under braking. Whether you're riding through city traffic, carving mountain roads, or touring long distances, the advanced floating construction and performance ventilation help deliver smoother braking, reduced heat build-up, and dependable stopping performance when you need it most. Ride with confidence. Brake with precision. Ride with 66BHP.4:Ta9a,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Experience sharper braking performance with the 66BHP Venta 282mm Floating Brake Disc, precision-engineered for the Yamaha R15 V4. Designed as a direct OEM replacement, this premium floating rotor installs without any modifications, making it the perfect upgrade for riders seeking improved braking feel, better heat management, and superior stopping power. Constructed with a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc is built to deliver consistent braking performance whether you're commuting, touring, or enjoying spirited rides. Key Highlights ✅ Direct Fit for Yamaha R15 V4 Designed to match OEM specifications for a hassle-free installation. No drilling, spacers, or alterations required. ✅ 282mm Performance Rotor Optimized rotor size provides stronger braking performance with excellent control and rider feedback. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision CNC-machined aluminium centre helps reduce unsprung weight while maintaining exceptional strength and durability. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor High-grade stainless steel braking surface ensures excellent wear resistance, consistent braking, and long service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Floating construction allows controlled movement between the carrier and rotor, improving pad contact while helping reduce brake judder. ✅ Performance Ventilation Performance-oriented ventilation pattern enhances airflow and heat dissipation, maintaining braking efficiency during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Delivers enhanced braking confidence, improved modulation, and dependable performance across all riding conditions. Features 282mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility Yamaha R15 V4 What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 282mm Floating Front Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? Engineered for riders who demand confidence under braking, the 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc combines lightweight construction, advanced floating technology, and a performance ventilation design to deliver consistent braking performance, reduced heat build-up, and superior stopping power. Whether you're riding through city traffic or pushing your bike on open roads, Venta is built to inspire confidence every time you brake. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.5:Td85,.bhp-desc, .bhp-desc * { box-sizing: border-box; } /* Mobile: full width */ @media (max-width: 749px){ .bhp-desc{ width:100vw !important; max-width:100vw !important; margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw) !important; margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw) !important; padding-left:12px !important; padding-right:12px !important; overflow:hidden !important; } .bhp-hero{ padding:16px !important; } .bhp-sec{ padding:14px !important; } .bhp-title{ font-size:22px !important; } .bhp-sub{ font-size:13px !important; } .bhp-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr !important; } .bhp-chip{ padding:9px 10px !important; } .bhp-kicker{ font-size:11px !important; } .bhp-cta{ padding:14px !important; } } 66BHP Performance Braking 66BHP Street Pro Semi-Ceramic Brake Pads – Stop With Authority Stronger bite | Cleaner wheels | Confident braking in rain Semi-Ceramic Compound Balanced performance Superior Stopping Better than organic Low Dust • Low Noise Smooth & quiet Built for Daily + Touring Performance with long life What Street Pro changes A good brake pad doesn’t just “stop” the bike—it improves control. Street Pro delivers a stronger initial bite and consistent braking feel, helping you slow down with more confidence in real-world traffic and touring speeds. Perfect for: City traffic • Weekend rides • Highway touring • Rainy commutes Upgrade you feel More control, less stress Better response from every brake pull Brakes are your bike’s most important performance upgrade—because speed is easy, but control is everything. 66BHP Street Pro Semi-Ceramic Brake Pads are engineered for riders who want a stronger bite, cleaner braking, and confidence in wet or dry conditions. From city traffic to winding highways, Street Pro helps you stop faster and ride safer. Awareness tip: If your current pads feel weak, noisy, or unpredictable in rain, you’re losing braking confidence. Upgrading to a semi-ceramic compound can dramatically improve braking feel and consistency. Why Street Pro Works Better 🛑 Stronger Stopping Power Enhanced braking performance compared to standard organic pads—more bite when you need it. 🎯 Better Brake Feel & Control A more consistent lever response helps you modulate braking smoothly—especially useful in traffic and corners. 🌧️ Reliable Wet Handling Maintains dependable braking in rain and humid conditions—less “scary” braking when roads get slick. 🧼 Low Dust = Cleaner Wheels Reduces brake dust buildup so your rims stay cleaner for longer—less frequent cleaning. 🔇 Low Noise, Smooth Ride Engineered for quieter braking—less squeal, more comfort, more confidence. ⏳ Longer Pad Life Semi-ceramic formulation reduces wear while maintaining consistent performance across long usage. Why semi-ceramic is the smarter upgrade Standard organic pads can feel softer and fade quicker under real riding conditions. Street Pro’s semi-ceramic compound is built for stronger bite, stable performance, and cleaner braking—so you get a noticeable upgrade without going extreme. Ideal For 🏙️ Daily city traffic 🛣️ Highway touring 🌧️ Rainy & wet conditions 🌀 Curves, flyovers & quick stops Upgrade your braking. Feel the difference. Switch to 66BHP Street Pro Semi-Ceramic Brake Pads for stronger stopping power, cleaner wheels, and confident control—every ride, every condition. *Braking performance may vary based on riding style, rotor condition, tyre grip, and installation quality.6:Td85,.bhp-desc, .bhp-desc * { box-sizing: border-box; } /* Mobile: full width */ @media (max-width: 749px){ .bhp-desc{ width:100vw !important; max-width:100vw !important; margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw) !important; margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw) !important; padding-left:12px !important; padding-right:12px !important; overflow:hidden !important; } .bhp-hero{ padding:16px !important; } .bhp-sec{ padding:14px !important; } .bhp-title{ font-size:22px !important; } .bhp-sub{ font-size:13px !important; } .bhp-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr !important; } .bhp-chip{ padding:9px 10px !important; } .bhp-kicker{ font-size:11px !important; } .bhp-cta{ padding:14px !important; } } 66BHP Performance Braking 66BHP Street Pro Semi-Ceramic Brake Pads – Stop With Authority Stronger bite | Cleaner wheels | Confident braking in rain Semi-Ceramic Compound Balanced performance Superior Stopping Better than organic Low Dust • Low Noise Smooth & quiet Built for Daily + Touring Performance with long life What Street Pro changes A good brake pad doesn’t just “stop” the bike—it improves control. Street Pro delivers a stronger initial bite and consistent braking feel, helping you slow down with more confidence in real-world traffic and touring speeds. Perfect for: City traffic • Weekend rides • Highway touring • Rainy commutes Upgrade you feel More control, less stress Better response from every brake pull Brakes are your bike’s most important performance upgrade—because speed is easy, but control is everything. 66BHP Street Pro Semi-Ceramic Brake Pads are engineered for riders who want a stronger bite, cleaner braking, and confidence in wet or dry conditions. From city traffic to winding highways, Street Pro helps you stop faster and ride safer. Awareness t