 even during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Delivers improved brake feel, enhanced modulation, and dependable braking performance for city riding, highway touring, and spirited cornering. Features 320mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility KTM Duke 250 (2017–2023) OE Cross Reference Compatible as a replacement for the following OEM reference numbers: JP131818 JF131876 These OE reference numbers are provided for fitment verification purposes only. What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? The 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc is developed for riders who expect premium braking performance without compromise. Combining a lightweight aluminium carrier, premium stainless steel braking surface, advanced floating technology, and a performance ventilation design, it delivers powerful braking, reduced heat build-up, and consistent performance ride after ride. Whether you're commuting, touring, or enjoying aggressive weekend rides, the Venta Floating Brake Disc provides the confidence and control your KTM deserves. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.62:Tc7c,Upgrade Your Braking Confidence Experience exceptional braking performance with the 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc, engineered specifically for the KTM Duke 390 (2017–2023). Designed for riders who demand precision, reliability, and maximum stopping power, this premium floating rotor delivers improved heat dissipation, sharper brake response, and consistent braking performance in every riding condition. Built with a lightweight CNC-machined aluminium carrier and a premium stainless steel braking surface, the Venta Floating Disc is a direct OEM replacement, ensuring an easy installation using the factory mounting points with no modifications or alterations required. Key Highlights ✅ Direct Fit for KTM Duke 390 (2017–2023) Designed to OEM specifications for perfect fitment. No drilling, spacers, or modifications required. ✅ 320mm Performance Rotor Large diameter rotor provides increased braking leverage for stronger, smoother, and more progressive braking performance. ✅ Lightweight Aluminium Inner Carrier Precision CNC-machined aluminium carrier reduces unsprung weight while maintaining exceptional strength and rigidity. ✅ Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Manufactured from high-grade stainless steel for excellent wear resistance, reliable braking performance, and extended service life. ✅ Floating Rotor Design Floating construction allows controlled movement between the carrier and braking surface, maintaining optimal pad contact while helping reduce brake judder. ✅ Performance Ventilation Performance-oriented ventilation pattern improves airflow and heat dissipation, ensuring fade-resistant braking even during repeated hard braking. ✅ Superior Stopping Power Provides enhanced brake feel, improved modulation, and dependable stopping performance for daily commuting, highway riding, and spirited cornering. Features 320mm Performance Floating Brake Disc Direct OEM Replacement No Alterations Required CNC Machined Aluminium Inner Carrier Premium Stainless Steel Outer Rotor Floating Construction for Consistent Braking Performance Ventilation Design Improved Heat Dissipation Enhanced Brake Feel & Modulation Corrosion Resistant Finish Precision Manufactured Vehicle Compatibility KTM Duke 390 (2017–2023) OE Cross Reference Compatible as a replacement for the following OEM reference numbers: JP131817 JF131876 These OE reference numbers are provided for fitment verification purposes only. What's Included 1 × 66BHP Venta 320mm Front Floating Brake Disc Why Choose 66BHP Venta? The 66BHP Venta Floating Brake Disc is engineered for riders who demand premium braking performance and complete confidence on every ride. Featuring a lightweight aluminium carrier, premium stainless steel braking surface, advanced floating technology, and a performance ventilation design, it delivers exceptional stopping power, reduced heat build-up, and consistent braking performance under all riding conditions. Whether you're commuting, touring, or pushing your KTM on winding roads, the Venta Floating Brake Disc is built to provide the control and confidence you need. Precision Engineered. Direct Fit. Superior Stopping Power. Ride with 66BHP.66:X\n6b:X\n6b:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"6H4oyVnlEj54daI7c5-Yk\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Brakes\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/brakes\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"handle\":\"brakes\",\"initialCollection\":{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555262017853\",\"handle\":\"brakes\",\"title\":\"Brakes\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/brake-pad-only-one-set.png?v=1787079452\",\"altText\":\"Brakes\"}},\"initialCollections\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555260772669\",\"handle\":\"air-filters\",\"title\":\"Air Filters\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/air-filter-bike.png?v=1787078101\",\"altText\":\"Air Filters\"}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555261559101\",\"handle\":\"premium-mirrors\",\"title\":\"Premium Mirrors\",\"descrip