esigned for aggressive riding and racing. They offer high levels of stopping power, even at high temperatures, and provide excellent feel and feedback to the rider. They are also resistant to fade and glazing, which can occur when brake pads get too hot and lose their friction properties. Fitment Note: Front : FD117G1370 Rear : FD117G1370 Included Items: 1 Set Comes with 2 HH Sintered Brake Pads Which Fits One Caliper\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"3499.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/250804CC-E797-4841-938D-59CB2F450738.png?v=1787074811\",\"altText\":\"Ninja 300 ABS Galfer Sintered Brake Pads\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881689248061\",\"title\":\"front\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"3499.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"3499.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52881689280829\",\"title\":\"rear\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"3499.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"amount\":\"3499.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"availableForSale\":true,\"quantityAvailable\":null}],\"brand\":\"Baycity\",\"category\":\"Brake Pads\",\"compatibility\":[\"motorcycle\",\"NINJA 300 ABS\",\"Ninja 300 ABS Galfer Sintered Brake Pads\"],\"specifications\":[{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Baycity\"},{\"name\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Brake Pads\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"rev-default-1\",\"author\":\"Verified Rider\",\"rating\":5,\"date\":\"2026-06-01\",\"title\":\"Genuine product\",\"comment\":\"Shipped fast, original packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"tags\":[\"motorcycle\",\"NINJA 300 ABS\",\"Ninja 300 ABS Galfer Sintered Brake Pads\"],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{}}},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473813442877\",\"handle\":\"honda-cb-650f-cbr-650f-galfer-sintered-brake-pads\",\"title\":\"HONDA CB 650F / CBR 65